        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/i-wake-and-feel-the-fell-of-dark-not-day.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/i-wake-and-feel-the-fell-of-dark-not-day.html",
            "title": "I Wake and Feel the Fell of Dark, Not Day",
            "summary": "I am gall, I am heartburn. God's most deep decree Bitter would have me taste: my taste was me; Bones built in me, flesh filled, blood brimmed the curse. Selfyeast of spirit a dull dough sours. I see The lost are like this, and their&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>I am gall, I am heartburn. God's most deep decree<br>Bitter would have me taste: my taste was me;<br>Bones built in me, flesh filled, blood brimmed the curse.<br><br>Selfyeast of spirit a dull dough sours. I see <br>The lost are like this, and their scourge to be<br>As I am mine, their sweating selves, but worse. </p>\n<p>-- Gerard Manley Hopkins (1844 –1889)</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/160/abstractalien.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"663\"></figure>",
            "image": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/160/abstractalien-2.png",
            "author": {
                "name": "Jujube"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "poetry"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-09-30T09:05:41-07:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-30T09:05:41-07:00"
        },
